obsolete|PASS: Replacement and loss of practical use match the source adjective rather than equating age with uselessness. Historical retention of workshop tools is plausible; the Vietnamese gloss does not claim a tool is broken.
totally|PASS: Complete change of narrative mood illustrates the adverb's emphatic scope. Totally is not assigned a universal CEFR or identity; the revised ending and resulting atmosphere are faithful in Vietnamese.
window|PASS: Wall/roof opening and associated glass/frame define the physical source boundary. Usually and sometimes allow varied window construction; the attic view introduces no unsupported computer-interface Sense.
aisle|REVIEW: Passage-between-rows semantics and silent-s pronunciation are correct. Beside the aisle of history books is less natural than at the end of the history-book aisle; apply a coupled EN/VI example overlay and re-review.
early|REVIEW: Adjective and adverb preserve separate POS and source ordinals. Earlier/earliest and early in a period are checked, but the combined temporal boundary and adjective wording main time remain content-review obligations.
